wnload/RunnerControl.dmg\\nREADME.md:56:https://github.com/relux-works/runner-control/releases/latest/download/appcast.xml\\nREADME.md:58:See [RELEASING.md](RELEASING.md) for host setup and release steps. Apple signing and notarization credentials are configured on macbook-iv. Download links become available after the first successful release workflow.\\nRELEASING.md:3:## One-time setup on macbook-iv\\nRELEASING.md:13:- The existing Sparkle Ed25519 signing key under account `works.relux.runnercontrol`. Keep a secure backup; losing it prevents updates to installed releases. Do not regenerate it for each release.\\nRELEASING.md:38:| Bundle and team | `works.relux.runnercontrol` / `262RZ595FP` | `release_metadata.py prepare` |\\nRELEASING.md:42:| Sparkle account and feed | Account `works.relux.runnercontrol`; private key must match `SUPublicEDKey`; feed `https://github.com/relux-works/runner-control/releases/latest/download/appcast.xml` | `release-preflight.sh`, `prepare` |\\nRELEASING.md:44:| Appcast | Exactly one item; `sparkle:version` = build, `shortVersionString` = marketing version, enclosure URL `https://github.com/relux-works/runner-control/releases/download/<tag>/RunnerControl.dmg`, 64-byte `edSignature`, `length` = DMG bytes, minimum macOS 14 | `release_metadata.py verify` |\\nRELEASING.md:62:the login keychain on macbook-iv with a console login as the runner user (no\\nRELEASING.md:98:Core and release metadata tests pass locally and in GitHub Actions; the Sparkle-enabled app builds successfully. Developer ID signing and the notarytool profile are validated on macbook-iv. The complete notarization and update-install cycle requires the first accepted Apple submission and two published versions. Check GitHub Releases for publication status.\\nVALIDATION.md:6:- macOS build succeeded with bundle ID `works.relux.runnercontrol` and Apple Development team `262RZ595FP`; signature verified with codesign.\\nVALIDATION.md:8:- Registration path: `/Users/iv/Library/GitHubActions/macbook-iv/_work`; no spaced Application Support path in `.runner`, `.env`, `.path` or service manifest.\\nVALIDATION.md:9:- Existing GitHub job https://github.com/relux-works/skill-project-management/actions/runs/35028909296/job/104582517367 passed `actions/setup-go@v5`. Its remaining test suite was still in progress during validation.\\nVALIDATION.md:13:- https://github.com/relux-works/skill-ios-app-manager/commit/71a3fff\\nVALIDATION.md:14:- https://github.com/relux-works/skill-ios-app-manager/commit/b2aee6c\\nVALIDATION.md:15:- https://github.com/relux-works/skill-swift-relux/commit/cafaa85\\nVALIDATION.md:16:- https://github.com/relux-works/skill-ios-testing-tools/commit/171258a\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 3442,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 861,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
