rror {\n415|                throw RunnerRegistration.RegistrationError.missingPermission(\n416|                    permissionHelp(scope: .organization(org: org), detail: text)\n417|                )\n418|            }\n419|            throw error\n420|        }\n(more lines below)","final_result":true}}}
