y, explicit transition semantics and preserved current running state as applicable. CUA also confirms existing runner detail only offers generic GitHub link, reinforcing post-registration-repository-editor.md. Root will quit this candidate before rebuild. No production runner state changed.\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1261,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 316,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
